@using Csp.Api.HelperClasses
@using Csp.Api.Model
@model Csp.Web.DataTransferObjects.CustomizeBulkRegistrationDto
@{ 
    ActionHelper actionHelper = Model.ActionHelper;
    var divUniqueId = "ReviewBulkRegistration";

}
<div id="@divUniqueId">
    <div class="response-notification bulk-registration-review-notification"></div>
    @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
    <div class="content">
        <div class="grid-header">
            <div class="grid-left">
                <input type="button" class="k-button" value="Expand All" onclick="ExpandAll(this);"/>&nbsp;
                <input type="button" class="k-button" value="Collapse All" onclick="CollapseAll(this);"/>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-right">
            </div>
        </div>

        <div>
            @{Html.RenderPartial("../Partial/_BulkRegistrationCustomize", Model);}
        </div>
        <div>&nbsp;</div>

        @Html.Partial("../Partial/_Eula", Model.Eula)

        <div>&nbsp;</div>

        <div>
            <input type="button" class="k-button bulk-registration-review-finalize" onclick="FinalizeCustomizations(this);" value="Confirm and Finalize Bulk Activation"/>
            @if (Model.BulkRegistrationId.HasValue)
            {
                <input type="button" class="k-button bulk-registration-review-cancel" onclick="BulkRegistrationManageUtil.DiscardDraft(this);" value="Cancel and Discard Progress"/>
            }
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<style>
    .error-notification {
        height: 100%;
    }
</style>
<script>
    var supportAccountId = function () {
        return @Model.SupportAccountId;
    }();
    var bulkRegistrationId = function () {
        return @Model.BulkRegistrationId;
    }();

    function ExpandAll() {
        var allDevices = $('.device-info-header');

        if (allDevices.length > 0) {
            allDevices.find('.toggle').removeClass('plus').addClass('minus');
            allDevices.siblings('.device-info').slideDown("slow");
        }
    }

    function CollapseAll() {
        var allDevices = $('.device-info-header');

        if (allDevices.length > 0) {
            allDevices.find('.toggle').removeClass('minus').addClass('plus');
            allDevices.siblings('.device-info').slideUp("slow");
        }
    }

    function FinalizeCustomizations(e) {
        var self = this;

        e.preventDefault ? e.preventDefault() : e.returnValue = false;
        var message = "Are you sure, you want to finalize?";
        var data = $('div.list-customize-bulk-activation').data('kendoListView').dataSource.data();

        if (data.length === 0) {
            SupportPortal.Message("There are no devices to save");
            return;
        }

        var saveAction = function () {
            $(e).prop('disabled', true);
            SupportPortal.ClearNotification();
            SupportPortal.BlockUI();

            $.ajax({
                url: '@Url.Action("FinalizeCustomizations", "BulkRegistration")',
                type: 'POST',
                dataType: 'json',
                data: JSON.stringify({ SupportAccountId: supportAccountId, BulkRegistrationId: bulkRegistrationId, BulkRegistrationDevices: data }),
                contentType: 'application/json; charset=utf-8',
                headers: { "__RequestVerificationToken": $("input[name=__RequestVerificationToken]").val() },
                cache: false
            }).fail(function(e) {
                SupportPortal.Notification("Failed to finalize your bulk activation.", SupportPortal.NotificationType.Error);
            }).done(function(e) {
                if (e.Success) {
                    //SupportPortal.Notification(e.Message, SupportPortal.NotificationType.Success, $('.bulk-registration-review-notification'));

                    var redirectAction = function() {
                        location.href = '@(Url.Action("Devices", "SupportAccount", new {id = Model.ActionHelper.Id, assetType = "ClaimedAssets"}))';
                    };

                    SupportPortal.Message('Your bulk registration has been submitted for processing. This could take a few minutes to complete.', { height: 130, width: 350, actions: {} }, function() { redirectAction(); });
                } 
                else {
                    SupportPortal.Notification(e.Message + '<br/>' + e.Errors.join('<br/>'), SupportPortal.NotificationType.Error, $('.bulk-registration-review-notification'));
                }
            }).always(function () {
                SupportPortal.UnBlockUI();
                $(e).prop('disabled', false);
            });
        };

        SupportPortal.Confirmation(message, function () { saveAction(); }, null);
    }

    $(document).ready(function () {
        var isReviewMode = '@Model.IsReviewMode';
        CustomizeBulkRegistrationManageUtil.Init({
            uniqueId: '@divUniqueId',
            isReadOnly: (isReviewMode.toUpperCase() === "TRUE"),
            countries: function () {
                return @Html.Raw(JsonConvert.SerializeObject(Model.Countries));
            }(),
            regions: function () {
                return @Html.Raw(JsonConvert.SerializeObject(Model.Regions));
            }(),
            deviceCategories: function () {
                return @Html.Raw(JsonConvert.SerializeObject(Model.DeviceCategories));
            }(),
            urlGetBulkRegistrationDevicesWithLicenses: '@Html.Raw(Url.Action("GetBulkRegistrationDevicesWithLicenses", "BulkRegistration", new { bulkRegistrationId = Model.BulkRegistrationId, supportAccountId = Model.SupportAccountId }))'
        });
    });
</script>